.terraform/
terraform.tfstate
terraform.tfstate.backup
terraform.tfvars
*.tfvars
# Pre-apply gate/plan artifacts (#6767): the binary plan and its JSON render are
# written into this dir by the apply workflow — never commit them (defence-in-depth).
tfplan
tfplan.json
# #7104 PR-B: the bounded re-push's own plan artifacts. tfplan-repush.json carries the live prd
# Doppler token and the webhook HMAC in CLEARTEXT (terraform's JSON serialization ignores
# `sensitive`), and the binary tfplan-repush survives on the runner whenever the apply step is
# skipped — the grade-refused path. The glob covers both.
tfplan-repush*
